e oscar for the documentary summer of  soul or when the revolution could not be  televised smith said he could still see  the look in quest love's eyes and  apologized to the roots drummer i'm  sorry really isn't  sufficient will smith may have finally  broken his silence on what happened on  oscar night but chris rock is also  telling his side of the story the  comedian is currently touring the  country with kevin hart and during a  performance in new jersey he spoke out  about how the slap impacted him and what  he thought of the entire debacle  according to nbc news rock said that he  wasn't a victim and while it hurt he  still managed to go to work after the  fact he concluded by saying i don't go  to the hospital for a paper cut rock  actually performed shortly after the  incident occurred but he refrained from  talking about the slap at the time he  only briefly alluded to it saying how he  would talk about it at a later time jada  pinkett smith spoke about the incident  back in june on red table talk she hoped  the two could reach some sort of  understanding saying my deepest hope is  that these two intelligent capable men  have an opportunity to heal talk this  out and reconcile brock has yet to  respond to smith's latest apology so  this saga would appear to be ongoing
 

